#: scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 507830f0f166795aa68957ce0edcdb988ecc01d318cdef20a906807fefe9441c
#. default-sha256: b7ce6f48b2358f82d1dac114c3b35482f89b78d8378debe11eca24d3e997be81
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_4192DE52_71D2_4CD7_A2B6_2560383B81C3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫I didn’t really "
"understand Michel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫わたしにとって、⟪k:14⟫ミ"
"シェルは、⟪k:15⟫よく分からない人だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e42ba8bdf29a89369ff32eb8485f0ec887d0e4940bc696852477dce69213451c
#. default-sha256: bef8cf95d48d1e119e52f584baa7396ab25291fb3a7a1446734827768b6f1905
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2175D33D_9FEE_4962_9030_ACDA650195EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that was probably because we were still essentially strangers."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でもきっと、⟪k:1⟫それはまだ、⟪k:2⟫お互いのことを知らなさすぎるだけ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2244e2769b19bd7c52b9c30411825700366f38acea9cb1aa70c998e7b50e06b8
#. default-sha256: f6d6a478c67bcd6eb1ec0251467209f66dd6869e87b70f8c7017364754ee5c1e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B9E5076F_86BC_4FCD_8795_13236C3198BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having been sent to the mansion as reparation for my mistakes,⟪k:1⟫I wasn’t sure who I might "
"find there,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“罪”を償うためにわたしはこの館に送られた。⟪k:1⟫だから、⟪k:2⟫どんな人がいるのだろうと思ってい"
"たけれど……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24dccede5916014dca069655e89e88e71e7f5f34d3aa4471fe36aaa9f2773893
#. default-sha256: b1f7aaedaf20bc4e41c10d258570fa21d11cc0ef97f1dd9e5c226192abbd2044
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A3ED3E4_ACAB_4EEC_A286_785C54D46722"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but I was tentatively convinced he wasn’t a ⟪k:1⟫terrible⟪k:2⟫ person.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He didn’t do "
"anything to me—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫except stay away."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫今のところ、⟪k:1⟫ミシェルがひどい人だとは思えなかった。⟪k:2⟫わたしに手を出すこともなく、⟪k:3⟫"
"ただ、⟪k:4⟫距離を置こうとするだけ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e78bccd04d6920ce2d3d4deb7fa3bffa227f3d427f565d73584203abd279d863
#. default-sha256: ba583ace3feb97ca1b8f2b76325d062490010735adc5846fadba413ff5630f52
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_1A399BDC_0574_4BE2_B2F0_3315DDB85EE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his time in his chambers,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼はほとんどの時間を自室で過ごしているようだった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2766e24c9815cb7288abbeee9411788ef02bb68ec60ff3a590a6618dff752440
#. default-sha256: 930f402bbdd42cb8ea9c1e44f3d6bf152c74cf761dba746651b384031c196b1c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6AD7B8F3_2F9A_4C61_9642_13D41D84E7C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫which he had told me to never enter under any circumstances,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その部屋には、⟪k:1⟫絶対に入らないように言われている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e70ad32be14c1c4ab033383e83f81cf98cfafd131e6ec90f2953fe651262cd8
#. default-sha256: fd0ec8a53963bbc4329a28a755bc8badafccf15cd609bc72c53257c5a7f30140
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_837EFFAC_46B5_46CA_90AC_C53143E2947A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we rarely encountered one another in the halls."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから屋敷の中にいてもほとんど顔を合わせない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8afb8974d3c3629244117c847f523536146008a968a0ccc30c78f19acc5e0bd
#. default-sha256: fe38510d5fa6e9715093bd811f597c985c51d0d6adfcca68c72e7cdde960c042
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5C61B705_A21D_410F_B346_EB157082420C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For that reason, I made an effort to be kind and cheerful on the sporadic occasions we ⟪k:1⟫"
"did⟪k:2⟫ cross paths."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫だからこそ――たまに会った時くらいは。⟪k:2⟫明るく接しようと思っていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52c30ffaa78e7590482c43b4a0e5e1432df7cf3dbe664b48309e29b5db7f27b1
#. default-sha256: 73f26039024ab86eada768780c8e512590211ab798ce2945841023997725f2a2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_DD88F4CD_6D98_4C70_B736_FA324FDB6E3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I figured if I kept that up long enough,⟪k:1⟫he would eventually warm up to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そうすれば――、⟪k:1⟫彼も心を開いてくれるかもしれない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce664721833edeb42d10ddc740319f5dcff2f418e7f24d4635bdd69e8dad8926
#. default-sha256: fe8e99bf5929d5c24f219560192667abcc9fb695d833aabe08d94f2725849175
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C5F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as new housemates, being able to enjoy our time together was obviously preferable to the "
"alternative."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だってせっかく同じ場所にいるのだから、⟪k:1⟫楽しく過ごした方が良いに決まっている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a530db005a9bb3aed06b5053045f650d695b51488ae89d873f07aada0e419bdd
#. default-sha256: 3bf2368a8ce12d72f579216d931ea0fbb7904d2095895fc368c1856404b9cdcc
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE03C6F8F9BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If I did manage to break the ice, I hoped we would be able to do some talking—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"about the mansion, about him, about me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫心を開いてくれたら……、⟪k:1⟫きっと色々な話が出来るようになるだろう。⟪k:2⟫この館のこととか、"
"⟪k:3⟫彼のこととか、⟪k:4⟫わたしのこととか。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a41cc626416450ef43252648f5736747b22e714e6721c92b986f7e3252406c8c
#. default-sha256: bebb336f61ec1e720b4b6535b5724cf118548d0aa367543f28628d709b92d5b5
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9C8A8B5A_8305_40B6_B42D_DE23C5F8F9BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I just had to keep working at it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それまで頑張ってみようと――そんな風に、思っていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 524a9c95e772c859e039e5a6c28fe220f7fea7fc05032105d9b1f0bb86af83d2
#. default-sha256: 08969f6ae838c92d300f2b76de9f9bdeb6e4130b3c4c99759c2c2a8f4dc6bcf8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_94B28477_ABF4_482D_9AC5_C312F87772BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Michel didn’t need me to take care of him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He handled his own day-to-day needs "
"and activities by himself,⟪k:4⟫and in fact, he didn’t ask me for anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫身の回りのお世話は、⟪k:2⟫必要がなかった。⟪k:3⟫そもそも彼はわたしを頼らないし、⟪k:4⟫自分"
"のことはすべて自分でやってしまう。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aaf8244ca4736dc70ac9128123680eabb484f66d7c6442bbe79ad83b1ca43c39
#. default-sha256: 4e150ded6878c2005d4c7f727e4502813e850fe9eb016c51810693be0a8cf2c3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2CB58756_5E47_4229_A0F4_2057BBBB5DC5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫An aristocrat who had no use for his servant—⟪k:1⟫I hadn’t met anyone like him before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫使用人を使わない貴族。⟪k:1⟫そういう人には、⟪k:2⟫初めて会った気がする。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efa89c1e79df89cd088a35a7d422e9766625d3abf83f0829d09d0132329a7553
#. default-sha256: 107ed8115d285dc3ff30a5206bb8d594a0b0b8837326b5d34dd2d7f9a0ceabd9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_08503938_3750_4B42_AD57_9D4057420069"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All right, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………よし。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22894a218e057313c3271f2d6db7c513c0670e1c1db164bea4c4fb50a9655bb2
#. default-sha256: a74df75fe72b7af4ccf2186d46e10b0b1f65a47dc557c889a65ebe0de72a29ba
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_22229AC0_62EC_4C47_BBB6_981E435ED90D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That meant about all I could do was clean."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だから、⟪k:1⟫やれることと言えば、⟪k:2⟫部屋の掃除くらいだった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74ce1d8cc44fa87624884f65868304a9380e52e48633470bb7d95afbe0859514
#. default-sha256: f5a26c3074e93ae6dfd6c1caf1fd1ade7d03d9091c51ef5ed4ab2c46cd1765b3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EBDE2311_051B_4F20_8957_58F329E531C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure how his room looked,⟪k:1⟫but the rest of the house was, quite frankly,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼の自室がどうなっているのかは知らないけれど、⟪k:1⟫その他の部屋は、⟪k:2⟫正直言って……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d60c67ef921d124ef37ef92ee82ec369840c506a102f876a99de1a16b711e20e
#. default-sha256: b1f6ba1d1f3b6b3109e7c11625c483f7dd39a4c51a4fa3ae921a6bd5e82ebf90
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_28A590F8_3E65_4CBA_9BB6_6B6A1F40E6F7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫an absolute disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ひどい状態だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61f003a0a16a2719115a1f739a2fc61413b405e0eece1a6444ed15d17ac30f90
#. default-sha256: 0862711a873bed750447978bfbe27fa60757c90b03142f8a94e34e3fe7dde285
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9ABE020C_6F10_4175_8CBE_9513F1C4460F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The dust was so heavy it was obvious it hadn’t been touched in years."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何年掃除をしていないのだろう、⟪k:1⟫というほど、⟪k:2⟫埃が積もっている。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5c720999d6fe02e14060d913a008f185a7f37a28745d12aef12afff07cdfd6a
#. default-sha256: 94c48f4a7234e95b05179fac68535dd293b4fdc55183fe8587d4428f7cdfbdb0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_70932162_D4E5_48C0_AA9E_46305E93B326"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Let’s get started!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫やるわよ……！"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a02762a96bc65d8ee5686caa7dd2421a8c04b356a04990de4506c794d3120e7
#. default-sha256: 42fa7720270490f73223f12d38ed7c7ff0011369c00d2f07d54853ee6a7dbcf2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7F83E47E_F419_4757_9041_BA63BE0ED8E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It couldn’t be healthy to live in these conditions, so I set out to clean each room in the "
"house one by one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫こんな状態では、⟪k:1⟫衛生的にも良くない。⟪k:2⟫わたしは屋敷の部屋を、⟪k:3⟫順々に綺麗にしていく"
"ことにした。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67b1b8342022c38654560dae3c73c9c40575f9edb96a7ec1b7a5124e63f6563e
#. default-sha256: 7be5868ea84d9a4e90fb48986860a7e3c37709249a56379f6724be9827021d88
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_96BE2FEC_54AA_46B0_989A_AF2BB4AAAA82"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That said, it wasn’t going to be an easy task."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれどそれは、⟪k:1⟫中々に骨の折れる仕事だった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1312d01ce49c1cf1c7eede224cf5c5dd7e824c594f2a61e4eb18fe54f3cf3ad9
#. default-sha256: 7d660375ec803926df1b23291e1ea562c0eee4bc74d6389ea695d6ea42208dc4
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_903B6B3D_F1A4_4D9A_8915_EDFF16189AFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not because I was bad at cleaning—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in fact, I considered myself quite good at it—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫掃除に慣れていないのでは決してなく――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫むしろ、⟪k:3⟫得意な方なんだけれど――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2f6032be4ba8376f2c3b028c5813776f39432fa2a7432b6178b8bb262c6f4f1
#. default-sha256: c904e7bc77762fb78ba59872a094a99025d0072789495979b4881d2296e2735b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6EED7906_7A20_4A87_9380_7D61E457C41A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but because it was near impossible to find all the dust and grime that needed cleaning under "
"the flickering light of a candle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫灯りといえば燭台に揺らめく蝋燭の炎くらいで、⟪k:1⟫その状態で隅々まで綺麗にするのは、⟪k:2⟫至難"
"の業。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8add7b35e34e8cb7e7cbd9557a854538c98e4c1b8259f24276441606b5b4f1fa
#. default-sha256: 8fd9685ade941692250535777f8c6fbe3038dddc23d06a0d4cfa2c384e8d7a64
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B410BE8E_78D9_44E6_BB98_E6A927B785DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I can’t understand how anyone sane can live in this dark.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What’s wrong with him?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫第一、⟪k:1⟫こんな真っ暗闇で生活してるなんて正気の沙汰じゃないわ。⟪k:2⟫どういうつもりなんだ"
"ろ……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af48b1fdefc2f3dd0a6dd2cd46aaf485315c6c17fb7015e8d7c84bca855638e5
#. default-sha256: 06c41e769a8e367c61ef761d27c80fb8de43c14630112694df4047f365f9de26
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_356CFF91_0BC9_440F_B59D_17FAB597849E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Maybe... ⟪k:1⟫he’s actually a vampire."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あの人、⟪k:1⟫ひょっとして……吸血鬼か何かだったりして。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_4CE48C0B_1CCE_4B76_9C3C_186F60FDDC5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8614189c4f52170f9cf133beead52b83b51637387414b0cedfc39c765ea47fc2
#. default-sha256: 4486dd5dc23ba5dd65249153fc528db0a013329a809cf0c0483a773075549e63
